{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Patterns 是一款讓你自行設計生成式桌布的工具，適合想為 iPhone、iPad 或 Mac 打造個人化螢幕背景的使用者。你可以調整不同視覺參數並以完整解析度輸出，現時於 App Store 限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂生成式桌布</h2>\n<p>App 內提供 40 種生成式風格，涵蓋漸變、紋理、幾何與粒子 4 個系列，並可按名稱或分類搜尋。開啟編輯器後，你可以調整比例、密度、複雜度、對稱、旋轉、深度、光暈、模糊及對比度等參數，亦能使用系統取色器替換色彩或隨機化種子。作品可輸出 HD、QHD 或 4K PNG，支援直向與橫向尺寸，並可收藏、保留歷史紀錄及分享；整個運算過程均在裝置上完成。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Patterns: Create Wallpapers</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T11:39:25.491713+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}